  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2025-02-13T03:20:55.008Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "The new camera dolly is amazing. I can not see a way to cycle through different node settings without having to walk up to them to manual adjust them at the node. \n\nCan you add a way to cycle the camera preview window between nodes so we can easily adjust each node setting no matter where we are in the map?  \n\nOverall, amazing job on the dolly system!",
